#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:1
msgid "Adding a datum to a format"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:3
msgid "*I have a format, and a datum I want it to extract. What do I do?*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`../writing-a-format` answers the larger question — a report nothing"
" supports, to a passing suite. This area answers the smaller one that "
"comes up far more often: the format exists, it reads its holdings, and "
"now the statement of net assets has to come out of it too."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:9
msgid ""
"The five steps are always the same, and they are in this order for a "
"reason."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:11
msgid "Step"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:11
msgid "Page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:11
msgid "1. find the pages that carry the datum, and read one"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{doc}`finding-and-reading`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:11
msgid "2. decide which segment each part of the reading belongs to"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{doc}`where-each-logic-lives`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:11
msgid "3. write it at the most constrained level that holds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{doc}`choosing-a-level`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:11
msgid "4. freeze it, one test per **recipe**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{doc}`recipes-and-tests`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:11
msgid "5. when it holds, see whether the level can go up"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/adding-a-datum/index.md:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{doc}`choosing-a-level` again"
